					<td id="NewsCell"><font size = 4><b>If you've applied...</font></b> <br><font size = 2><i>Dhido                - 4/1/2003 4:29:21 PM</i></font><br><br><P>Due to technical error, any apps sent in the 5 days, give or take a few days have been lost.</P>
<P>PLEASE re-submit your application. If you are unsure as to whether or not your application has been lost, please contact an officer in-game.</P>
<P>We apoligize for the inconvenience. </P><br><hr align = left width = 10%><font size = 4><b>Recruiting.</font></b> <br><font size = 2><i>Solanthious          - 3/30/2003 4:46:59 PM</i></font><br><br><P>Not much going on, farm mobs is all, Dain, Tunare, Arch Lich, etc. Popped in to talk about recruiting abit.</P>
<P>Recruiting is open for most classes, get in touch with Grawr, Floob, Dhido, or me. All applicants will be considered, we're looking for dedicated players that like to work with small numbers, be part of a team, and have fun progressing through Everquest without alot of pressure. If you're brand new to high level play, &nbsp;or coming back to it after a hiatus, look one of us up, or simply apply <A href=http://www.oryxguild.com/oryx/application.aspx>Here.</A></P>
<P>~Solanthious</P><br><hr align = left width = 10%><font size = 4><b>Heh</font></b> <br><font size = 2><i>Solanthious          - 3/22/2003 3:42:21 AM</i></font><br><br><P><STRONG>So like, imho, mobs that have rings associated with them, should pop when&nbsp; the RING does, or the ring mobs need to pop when the MOB is suppose to, nuff said.</STRONG></P>
